  lockedText: "Heard the picky one next door is still testing you. Pass that, then come find me."
  offerText: "I've eaten raw fish all week. Cook one for me, would you? Bring it on a plate."
  reminderText: "Still dreaming of that cooked fish."
  exactText: "That's the one. Couldn't have done it better myself."
  extraText: "You brought the whole kitchen. I'll take it all."
